<title>USA: Clinton to speak on budget after meeting advisers.</title>
<headline>Clinton to speak on budget after meeting advisers.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton will meet his budget advisers on Tuesday morning and will make a statement on efforts to enact balanced-budget legislation, the White House said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>White House spokesman Mike McCurry told reporters Clinton was likely to meet his advisers at around 1030 EDT (1430 GMT) and would speak to reporters to emphasize the importance of balanced-budget legislation at 1130 EDT (1530 GMT).</p>
</text>
